  "reference": "Cakirok 28",
  "verseCount": 22,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "GEN 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Isaka olwoŋo Yakobo to miyo go silwany, aka ociko go teltel ni, “Ikir'inywom dhako Jakanan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ay ikadhi Mesopotamia, i ot pa Bethuel ba yokin, aka inywom acel kwoŋ nyir pa nerin Laban omin yokin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Were Majameni je womiyin silwany aka womiyin nyithindho kweth, ŋey ibedi ba piny kweth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.17.4+GEN.17.5+GEN.17.6+GEN.17.7+GEN.17.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 17:4-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weyi go womiyin gi nyikwayin silwany paka omiyo Abraham, ŋey widoŋ gi lowo m'ibed'iye ma Were omiyo Abraham!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno to Isaka oro Yakobo kadho. Aka Yakobo okidho Mesopotamia bongi Laban wod pa Bethuel Jaramean, omin Rebeka yok Yakobo gi Esau.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Esau nywomo dhako man",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo Esau oneno ni Isaka oyido otieko miyo Yakobo silwany to dhiro go Mesopotamia rango dhako kenyo, aka ni munyo miyo go silwany ociko go teltel ni, “Ikir'inywom acel kwoŋ mon ma Kanan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo oyido owinjo bamere gi min to kidho Mesopotamia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno munyo Esau oneno ni mon ma Kanan jokisangala Isaka bamere, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "okidho bongi Isimayil wod pa Abraham to nywomo nyare m'ilwoŋo ni Mahalath, m'oyido obedo nyamin Nebayoth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yakobo leko i Bethel",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo oeye Berseba, to kidho yu Haran. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka otundo i kabedo moro to bedo kenyo wor no rupiri waŋceŋ oyido otieko podho. Okwanyo tele acel kanyago to theno gine wiye to nindo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.1.51"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yoh 1:51",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aka oleko kenyo nike oyido nitie madala m'ocom wok piny, to wiye tundo kiri i polo; aka oneno jomalaika pa Were ka joidho aka doko jolor'iye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "GEN.13.14+GEN.13.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Cak 13:14-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go oneno Rwoth ocungo i wiye to waco ni, “An Rwoth, Were pa Abraham benin, aka Were pa Isaka; alamiyin gi nyikwayin lowo m'inind'iye me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyikwayin jobino cale fukefuke ma piny. Jobino nyay i thenge gi thenge aka luwo kwoŋ jo abino miyo piny je silwany. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neni, anitie kodin, aka abino kurin kisi kam'inokidh'iye, t'adwokin i lowo me; rupiri akibino weyin cuka anotiek timo gim'atieko waco rin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Yakobo ocew wok i nindo pere aka owaco ni, “Adieri Rwoth nitie ka, aka oyido akuya.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lworo omako go to waco ni, “Kole ka miyo jo lworo! Me k'obedo giman kwanyo woko Ot pa Were, aka me waŋkac ma polo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno Yakobo oay con odikin, aka okwanyo tele m'oyido go otheno gine wiye, to jengo paka siro aka okonjo mo i wiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go olwoŋo kenyo ni Bethel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28:19",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bethel",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nyutho Ot pa Were",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " To nyingi tindi madwoŋ oyido ilwoŋo ni Luz. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo Yakobo otimo cikirok ka waco ni, “Ka Rwoth obedi kodan, to kuran i yo paran m'akidh'iye, to miyan cemo gi nanga aruka, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ŋey doko adwoki i ot pa baba i siem, nyaka Rwoth bino bedo Were paran ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 28:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka tele me, m'aketho paka siro me, bino bedo Ot pa Were; aka kwoŋ kisi gim'inomiyan je, abino miyin acel wiy apar.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.28.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.28.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
